# Habits from Go (docs/design/agents.md 1.5, compiler/habits.azl): each is answered with an
# error that names the habit and says the azoL form, and with the edit when it is mechanical.
==== E0221: `println(1)`
---- file a.azl
fn main() {
    println(1)
}
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 1
---- reports E0221 2:5
---- apply-fix
---- after-has a.azl
    print(1)
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 0
